-- MT2009_PLUS_DIGI_SERVER_QOL_V1: Seon-Hae's book exchange (20095, the first
-- villages). Autor: Digi Rasta (nowy-system v0.23.0, ksiegi_seonhae.quest;
-- the "SKILLBOOK_COMB_SYSTEM" of his Biore list). Ten skill books of any kind
-- and 1 000 000 Yang for one random "Instr." book of the player's own class
-- and skill group. This quest only opens the window: it writes which Seon-Hae
-- was spoken to (ksiegi_seonhae.npc_vid, ksiegi_seonhae.npc_time) and sends
-- "NOWY_KSIEGI open"; the window (uiskillbookexchange.py in the client root)
-- sends "/nowy_ksiegi <10 cells>" and the core checks everything again - the
-- NPC, the books, the Yang (playerbot_digi_qol.h). Not for bots.
quest ksiegi_seonhae begin
	state start begin
		when 20095.chat."Wymiana ksi¹g umiejêtnoœci" with not pc.is_bot() begin
			setskin(NOWINDOW)
			pc.setqf("npc_vid", npc.get_vid())
			pc.setqf("npc_time", get_time())
			cmdchat("NOWY_KSIEGI open")
		end
	end
end
